WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:01.367
♪ (GENTLE MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:03.536
TANYA MCQUOID:<i> Whenever I stay
 at a White Lotus,</i>

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:06.406
I always have a memorable time.
Always.

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:11.211
Welcome to the White Lotus
in Sicily.

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:13.780
<i> La dolce vita.</i>

00:00:15.347 --> 00:00:18.518
You guys are here to learn
about your Sicilian roots?

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:20.386
<i>Sounds like a fun boys' trip.</i>

00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:22.488
Wasn't supposed to be
a boys' trip.

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:24.057
We're on a family vacation
right now

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:25.158
and it's just the three of us

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:27.193
<i> 'cause all the women
 in our family hate you.</i>

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:29.195
Please, can we just drop it?

00:00:31.597 --> 00:00:32.965
CAMERON BABCOCK:
<i> Now that he's loaded,</i>

00:00:33.032 --> 00:00:34.800
do you think he regrets marrying
such a dud?

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:35.902
What is going on with you?

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:37.537
There's a reason they invited
us here.

00:00:38.137 --> 00:00:40.406
<i>It's like you sold your company,
 you got rich,</i>

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:41.674
and now he's your best friend?

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:44.343
<i>Are these the kind of people
we're going to be hanging out
 with now?</i>

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:46.479
Did you vote, babe? Be honest.

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:48.548
I did. Didn't I?

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:50.583
Doesn't matter.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.185
♪ (TENSE MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:53.285 --> 00:00:54.920
Flirting is one of the pleasures
of life.

00:00:55.087 --> 00:00:56.355
You're 80 years old.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:59.258
BERT DI GRASSO:<i> But the women
 I desire remain young.</i>

00:00:59.425 --> 00:01:01.161
<i> You can relate to that.</i>

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:05.231
I just wanted to inform you
that my good friends here,

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:07.133
they're gonna be visiting me
this week.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:08.435
Coming and going.

00:01:09.034 --> 00:01:10.403
They come...

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:12.372
and go.

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:14.240
-See you later.
-SPEAKER: Bye.

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:15.608
I see.

00:01:16.775 --> 00:01:19.445
You bring your assistant
to a vacation with your husband.

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:21.881
It's not like she's gonna be
in our bed and stuff.

00:01:22.381 --> 00:01:24.583
<i>I don't know what's going on
 with Greg.</i>

00:01:25.117 --> 00:01:26.251
<i>But I think it's bullshit.</i>

00:01:26.385 --> 00:01:27.887
I think he's having an affair.

00:01:28.655 --> 00:01:30.890
I've seen a lot of guys
who, like, make all this money

00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:32.525
and they just
start acting different.

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:33.859
You guys party?

00:01:34.393 --> 00:01:37.197
-Lady Molly.
-CAMERON: (CHUCKLING)
My God, are you kidding?

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:39.866
-Let's fun! (GIGGLES)
-"Let's fun."

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:44.437
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:01:47.339 --> 00:01:50.577
A man does what he has to do,
but you keep it tight.

00:01:52.444 --> 00:01:55.648
<i>If you're sloppy, it's like
you're rubbing her face in it.</i>

00:01:56.716 --> 00:01:57.983
What happened last night?

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:01.354
It's just been a series
of very bad decisions.

00:02:01.854 --> 00:02:03.756
You've had very bad luck.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:06.259
♪ (MUSIC INTENSIFIES) ♪

00:02:07.159 --> 00:02:09.195
QUENTIN:<i> The best thing
 about luck is...</i>

00:02:10.096 --> 00:02:11.598
<i> it can always change.</i>

00:02:15.134 --> 00:02:16.135
♪ (MUSIC STOPS) ♪

00:02:16.369 --> 00:02:18.171
SPEAKER 2:
Italy's just so romantic.

00:02:18.704 --> 00:02:19.438
You're gonna die.

00:02:19.605 --> 00:02:21.040
I'm gonna have to drag you
outta here.

00:02:21.173 --> 00:02:24.544
